        "description": "A dependency edge on the wire (spine §5.2 `DepInput`).\n\nUsed both as a `query`/`dep`-tool edge input and as a `Create.deps` element. The model\n[`Dependency`] additionally carries a `created_at`/`created_by` — supplied by the adapter via\n[`DepInput::into_dependency`], not by the wire.",
        "properties": {
          "dep_type": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/DependencyType",
            "description": "The dependency type."
          },
